title Subsequence - View Story Info

control MangaService
entity ChapterModel
entity ChapterPurchaseModel
entity RatingModel
database MongoDB

MangaService -> ChapterModel: 1. find published chapters
activate ChapterModel
activate MangaService
ChapterModel -> MongoDB: 2. query chapters
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ChapterModel: 3. chapter list
deactivate MongoDB
ChapterModel --> MangaService: 4. return chapters
deactivate ChapterModel

opt User logged in
  MangaService -> ChapterPurchaseModel: 4.1. find purchased chapters
