  ChapterPurchaseModel -> MongoDB: 4.2. query purchases
  activate MongoDB
  MongoDB --> ChapterPurchaseModel: 4.3. purchased chapters
  deactivate MongoDB
  ChapterPurchaseModel --> MangaService: 4.4. return purchases
  deactivate ChapterPurchaseModel
end

MangaService -> MangaService: 5. map chapters (locked / purchased)
activate MangaService
space
deactivate MangaService
