activate RatingModel
RatingModel -> MongoDB: 7. aggregate ratings
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingModel: 8. rating summary
deactivate MongoDB
RatingModel --> MangaService: 9. return summary
deactivate RatingModel
deactivate MangaService